SUMMARY:Christmas Lights of Toronto: Yorkville! (RETURN FOR 2026)
DESCRIPTION:Toronto History Walks\n\\*\\***The Toronto History Walks Yearl
 y Pass is available. Get it now for $125.00 for 1 year of unlimited tours\
 , email**\n**torontohistorywalks@gmail.com**\n**for more information or fo
 r signing up!\\*\\***\n\n\\*\\* **Please note: Please e-transfer the ticke
 t amount when booking your space for this tour! You can e-transfer to the 
 following email at:**\n**torontohistorywalks@gmail.com**\n\nWe are back fo
 r another year of lights. Let's keep it going and celebrate Toronto!\n\nLe
 t's recapture the feeling of the holidays\, and celebrate the end of anoth
 er year. As 2026 begins to wind down\, a new year beckons. Let's enjoy the
  fall and take in the colour of the seasons. This tour explores the histor
 y of Yorkville at Christmas\, so it's a double tour of lights and history.
  Get your spots for this tour as soon as you can to be fully registered!\n
 \nResidents go above and beyond when decorating their homes and property. 
 The lights are exceptional and deserve to be shown off\, so let's look at 
 some of the most popular neighbourhoods when it comes to Christmas lights.
 \n\nAnd create a little Christmas magic in the meantime. Yorkville becomes
  a winter wonderland of multi-coloured lights. Let's explore this special 
 season.\n\nThe tour begins outside the Toronto Public Library - **Yorkvill
 e Branch** just west of Yonge Street on Yorkville Avenue!\n\n\\*\\* **Plea
 se note: Please e-transfer the ticket amount when booking your space for t
 his tour! You can e-transfer to the following email at:**\n**torontohistor
 ywalks@gmail.com**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/the-history-of-parkdale/events/316974
 125/
